    "bio": "My name is Saskia Zwaan. During my trip in China, I passed by an acupuncturist. I was actually curious about this therapy, but also very skeptical. Because I was having trouble with my knee, I decided to undergo a treatment. I found it vague and afterwards made fun of it a bit. However, the next day I noticed a big difference not only in my knee but in my whole body! Fascinated by this treatment, I started to delve into Traditional Chinese Medicine and regularly visited an acupuncturist in the Netherlands when I had any issues. She ultimately inspired me to learn the profession and now I can only say that acupuncture is the most beautiful thing I have ever learned! Who is acupuncture suitable for? For everyone, with mild to severe complaints. What can I do? I treat people ranging from zero to one hundred years old with various complaints; infertility, allergies, pregnancy-related issues, sleep problems, menopausal symptoms, stress, depression, back pain, gynecological issues, gastrointestinal problems, etc. but also colicky babies, children with ear infections, constipation, or other complaints. I am also specialized in cosmetic acupuncture for beautiful skin. My needles are extra thin and I do not use needles on babies and children.",
