    "bio": "I am Jos Nollen. With passion I support and stimulate my fellow human beings by providing tailored information; this can be through acupuncture but also through energetic intentions (buqi), information from Eastern and Western acquired knowledge. The goal is vitality, feeling happy and balanced. Optimal independent functioning. My whole life is focused on those core values. From a young age, I naturally grew into that. The professions of physiotherapist, acupuncturist, tai chi and qi gong teacher, buqi therapist are tailor-made for me. Through a lot of further education and practice, I can consciously and intuitively feel and usually achieve the jointly set goal. The practice is calm, which is important for recovery. Learning and practicing every day keep me sharp and young. Also see my website.",
