    "bio": "My name is Hans van Dorst. I graduated as a physiotherapist in 1981 and started my own physiotherapy practice in 1984. After studying osteopathy, I came into contact with acupuncture and graduated as an acupuncturist from EUTCM in 2000. I have worked for years as a physiotherapist, osteopath, and therapist in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), the latter as an acupuncturist and herbalist. After completing further education with Dr. Tan, I completed all levels with Suzanne Johnson in London and became very enthusiastic about the effectiveness and wide applicability of the Tung method. Since September 2020, I have transferred my physiotherapy practice and focus entirely on TCM, with the methods of Tung and Tan as my guiding principles.",
