    "bio": "My name is Marianne van der Meer. For years, I worked as an intensive care nurse within Western medicine. Even then, I was fascinated by other healing methods and quickly found myself drawn to Traditional Chinese Medicine, which includes acupuncture among other things. Every day, I am fascinated by our ability to heal and strengthen health in a natural way. My results make me proud every day, as does the wall of birth announcements from families I have been able to help in the past. Since 2009, I have been working as an independent acupuncturist in my practice in Hillegersberg. My specialization is in treating infertility, pregnancy, menstrual, and menopausal symptoms. In addition, I have further specialized in sports injuries, allergy treatment, and pain treatment using the Dr. Tan method.",
