    "bio": "I am Leontien Reedijk. Through my work as a massage therapist and yoga teacher, I became interested in meridians and acupressure points used in Traditional Chinese Medicine years ago. Stories from my clients made it increasingly clear to me that there can be a psycho-emotional cause underlying physical complaints. Eventually, I decided to study acupuncture at Qing-Bai Academy because Traditional Chinese Medicine pays equal attention to the health of the body and mind. Now, as I treat people with acupuncture, I repeatedly experience that calming a busy or troubled mind significantly contributes to improving physical complaints. For this reason, I take ample time with my clients to hear the whole story and thus develop the most suitable treatment plan for body and mind.",
