    "bio": "I am Karina, acupuncturist, specialized in pain management and stress. After completing my four-year study at Qing Bai Academy, I started working at Fysiolife practice, owned by my colleague Mario de Wilde in The Hague. It quickly became clear that I love to experience how quickly and effectively acupuncture works in combating all kinds of pain and stress. From my own experience, I know that pain complaints often stem from stress. The origin can be both physical and psychological. Acupuncture aims to address both the symptoms and the cause! It is my passion to show people with both acute and chronic pain complaints that acupuncture can provide wonderful and fast results. Of course, I never stop learning. Every year, I enthusiastically and attentively attend many further training courses in the field of pain management and stress complaints. This ensures that you receive the best care for your complaints.",
