    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/12508/original/Portret_blauw_met_bril.JPG?1705609153",
    "bio": "My name is Irene Vos. After working with pleasure in the business world for a long time, I felt the need to take a different direction. Because personal experiences had made me curious about the workings of acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) in general, I decided to follow the four-year HBO study at the TCMA in Amsterdam. The knowledge I gained there has not only made me an acupuncturist but has also changed and enriched my view of the world. I remain curious about what moves a person, how we relate to each other, to nature, and to the world. That is what makes TCM and working as an acupuncturist so beautiful and interesting. Every person has their own unique story. I want to hear that story because it helps me understand how complaints have arisen and how they can be resolved.",
