    "bio": "My name is Eszter. I have always been interested in alternative medicine but my studies took a different direction. In 2007, I had my first acupuncture treatment and that was a decisive moment for me. I felt much better, had more energy. I also had many positive experiences during my pregnancy. That's why I started my acupuncture training in 2008. After obtaining my acupuncture diploma, I also obtained diplomas in Western medical basic knowledge (2013) and Tui Na therapist (2015). In 2013, I attended a course on Shonishin pediatric acupuncture in Belgium. In early 2016, I was introduced to the Balance Method and have been using this technique successfully in my practice since then. In 2021, I took a course on Pediatric Tui Na, and in 2022, I obtained my Diploma as a Teacher of Taiji Tao and Qigong. My mission is to help people prevent diseases, alleviate their pain, restore their health balance, and make life easier for chronically ill patients.",
