    "bio": "My name is Marc Zeeman. Since 1999 I have been working in healthcare. After my period as an anesthesia assistant at the OLVG, I started studying physiotherapy at the University of Utrecht. As a physiotherapist, I have specialized in spine-related disorders. During my work as a physiotherapist and anesthesia assistant, I came into contact with acupuncture, which sparked my interest. Since 2014, I have had my own acupuncture practice in Lelystad and Almere where I can treat a wide variety of complaints. The main technique I use is the Dr. Tan/Master Tung method, which can achieve rapid results. Since 2023, I have completed the Chinese Herbal Medicine course. This allows complaints to be addressed even more effectively. Sometimes in combination with acupuncture or only as herbal therapy. This includes conditions such as insomnia, menopausal symptoms, skin problems, menstrual complaints, digestive issues, and much more.",
