    "bio": "My name is Roxanne Gulikers. I have always known that I wanted to work in healthcare and after obtaining my havo diploma, I started studying physiotherapy. After working as a physiotherapist with great pleasure for over ten years, I wanted to further develop myself. I chose to study acupuncture because Traditional Chinese Medicine goes much further than the Western approach. It focuses much more on the person as a whole. So far, I have been able to help many people with their physical and/or psychological problems. If you want to know if I can help you too, feel free to contact me.",
