    "bio": "As a health freak, raised in the realm of Chinese Medicine, I have always been interested in the holistic aspect of health. In my Bachelor's and Master's in Religious Studies, Asian religions and philosophy - especially Taoism - were my favorite. In 2020, I started the Basic Training in Chinese Medicine at the Qing Bai Academy. From February 2024, I am a member of the professional association NVA and from June 2024, a graduate and practicing Acupuncturist, including a certificate in Western Medical Basic Knowledge. As a result, my treatments are reimbursed by almost all health insurers (be sure to check your supplementary insurance). Through various further training sessions with, among others, Kiiko Matsumoto, Kris Oosting, Martine Cornelissen, and Barbara Dudman, I have become acquainted with various methods of Chinese Medicine, which I also apply in practice. In addition, I continue to develop myself through further training, both in Chinese Medicine and Western Medical knowledge.",
