    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/12437/original/_DSC8720_72.jpg?1680531806",
    "bio": "My name is Gerard Timmermans. I started my career as a physio and manual therapist. At the moment, I work as an acupuncturist in my practice in Eindhoven. This is located in the Medisch Kwartier Eindhoven general practice, of which I am a co-owner. In addition, I work as an RVE manager for Labor Expertise & Sports Center at Libra Rehabilitation & Audiology. As an acupuncturist, I specialize in guiding clients with oncological complaints (including neuropathy, fatigue, and nausea), women with menopausal symptoms, and people with pain and other discomfort. I do this through special balance method protocols and nutrition and lifestyle advice. Without unnecessarily prolonging their treatment. To give back the quality of their life. I am a registered oncology acupuncturist and affiliated with the integrative oncology outpatient clinic of the Máxima Medical Center in Veldhoven. I support people during or after their treatment trajectory. In addition to being a member of the Dutch Acupuncture Association (NVA), I am affiliated with the Dispute Settlement Body for Alternative Treatment Methods (KAB). Want to know more or make an appointment? Then send an email or call the practice.",
