    "bio": "Women's medicine is a group practice for women's complaints in Utrecht. We treat women in different phases of their lives. We help women with unfulfilled desire for pregnancy. Other areas of focus are menstrual complaints; complaints during pregnancy, such as nausea and menopausal symptoms. Our team consists of 6 women. Iza van Geelen specializes in endometriosis, pain complaints, and immune issues. Lin Yi specializes in pregnancy complaints and menopausal symptoms. Esther van Dorst specializes in PCOS, endometriosis, and more complicated desire for pregnancy, such as fertility in oncology patients. Furthermore, both Esther and Iza are listed in the cancer referral guide. They can provide additional supportive treatment during and after cancer treatment.",
