    "bio": "My name is Trudi van Zeben-Schlaghecke. After working for years as a (pediatric) physiotherapist, the courses in acupuncture and Chinese herbal therapy, both at the TCMA, felt like coming home to me. The Chinese perspective on health and its preservation and restoration does justice to and integrates all aspects of the human system. Since 2017, if desired, I combine this with orthomolecular therapy. For me, this is the ideal combination of the 'best of two worlds'. I am eager to learn and continue to deepen and expand my knowledge. My starting point is a comprehensive intake for which I always take ample time. The treatments are continuously evaluated, and clients always receive lifestyle advice. Want to know more? Visit my website or call for information without any obligation.",
