    "bio": "My name is Zijun Lu. I have studied traditional Chinese medicine for a total of 7 years, (acupuncture, Tuina therapy, and Chinese Herbal Medicine) done many postgraduate courses during my work, Just like our human body, Chinese medicine is a wonderful world where you can continue to discover. We can relieve pain with just one needle, or regulate the Qi energy of our body to achieve balance to treat diseases. For example, we can find plants in our environment to help with our illnesses. Almost all plants that grow on the ground have medicinal properties, there is so much more to bring our body to health. Hospital research makes the diagnosis more accurate, which is more conducive to our treatment with traditional Chinese medicine, and disease prevention is also the most important part of traditional Chinese medicine Through our traditional Chinese medicine with the unique diagnostic method, I can know the physical and mental condition of a person and prevent many diseases through traditional Chinese medicine. I have a lot of experience and confidence in my work, and it is my wish to help everyone I can reach lead a healthy, spiritual, and happy life. I always work with great pleasure, You are welcome to my practice.",
