    "bio": "Welcome to my practice. With great pleasure, I introduce myself as an experienced acupuncturist, dedicated to promoting your health and restoring your personal balance. My name is Zheng Li, a passionate acupuncturist who works according to the TCM method. Acupuncture has the power to enhance the health and quality of life of patients by combining traditional Chinese medicine with modern techniques. You will receive a personalized treatment tailored to your medical needs. I am fascinated by the power of the human body to heal itself. Educated by the prestigious Shenzhou Open University and recognized and registered with the Dutch Association of Acupuncturists NVA. This ensures that you receive the highest quality of service. By using sterile needles, acupuncture points are gently stimulated along the meridians of your body, which act as energy pathways. This restores your vital energy, called Qi, and promotes the natural healing of your body. Whether you seek relief from pain, support for emotional well-being, such as cupping in your treatment plan. I am committed to staying informed of the latest developments in the field and continuously expanding my knowledge to provide you with the best possible care. I look forward to working with you to achieve your health goals. Together we will strive for balance, vitality, and a harmonious life. Feel free to contact me to schedule an appointment or ask questions. I am here to support you every step of the way.",
