    "focus": "Acupuncture, Acupressure, Cupping, Pediatric Acupuncture, Moxa, Ear Acupuncture, Wrist and Ankle Acupuncture, Five Element Acupuncture, Chinese Herbs, Chinese Nutrition, Qi Gong, Tui Na, Electro-acupuncture",
