    "bio": "My name is Roxanna Snapper, I am 33 years old and live in Huizen. I have worked with great pleasure in, among others, healthcare as an administrative assistant. I became interested in (complementary) healing methods through an acupuncturist who treated me very well at the time. I was so impressed by what he did that I knew one thing for sure, and that was that I wanted to help people just as he helped me back then. Therefore, in 2020 I obtained my diploma in Basic Medical Knowledge, in 2021 my diploma as a Sports Masseur, and in 2023 my training as an Acupuncturist. In addition to working in a sauna as a masseuse, I have been working as an independent masseuse in my own practice \"Double Balanced\" since December 2021. I have been trained by Myos as a Sports Masseur according to NGS standards. So with me, you can be sure that you will receive a high-quality massage and that I have the theoretical knowledge of the human body. As an acupuncturist, I graduated from the TCMA (Traditional Chinese Medicine Academy) with a thesis on insomnia. My company name 'Double Balanced' stands for both the physical and mental aspects that need to be in balance, but also for the combination of my professions acupuncture and massage. In addition to anti-aging and regular acupuncture treatments, I also offer relaxation, sports, cupping, and hot stone massages, among others. You are very welcome to visit my practice at Achterbaan 81 in Huizen.",
