    "bio": "My name is Pepijn Zuurdeeg. From the Eastern martial arts, my interest in TCM, Traditional Chinese Medicine, grew. This is how my passion for acupuncture started and the desire to help people improve their physical and mental well-being. The focus in my practice has increasingly shifted towards women's health, perhaps because they are more interested in this form of treatment. As an acupuncturist, I combine ancient Eastern medicine with modern insights. My treatments target the core of your issue. A very effective way of working. Over the years, I have specialized in successfully treating a wide range of health problems, such as pain complaints, stress, burnout, and emotional issues. Nowadays, I also successfully treat gynecological complaints. My expertise includes the treatment of cycle regulation, PCOS, endometriosis, vaginal complaints, infertility, pregnancy, postpartum, and menopause complaints. With acupuncture, I support the unique needs and challenges that women experience in different stages of life. I enjoy working towards achieving optimal health for my clients. They describe me as careful, gentle, reliable, and an almost painless acupuncturist. Call for an appointment 06 427 876 78, email: info@dynamicbalanceacupunctuur.nl or schedule your appointment online at www.dynamicbalanceacupunctuur.nl",
