    "bio": "At my practice, Essence of Juji, in the heart of Amsterdam, I offer a holistic approach to health based on Chinese medicine. My practice focuses mainly on supporting women through every phase of their lives. Whether it's harmonizing menstruation, supporting emotional well-being, or pregnancy and postpartum recovery, you are warmly welcome. As a trained acupuncturist (at Qing Bai) and birth doula (BiA Doula), I create a safe and calm environment where my clients can recover, grow, and find balance. Personal attention, presence, and intention are central to my treatments. (Treatments are available in both Dutch and English.) Juliette Eleonora Zoë Weersink",
