    "bio": "My name is Floor Pieper. Since 2008, I have had a practice for acupuncture and Shiatsu massage. I am well-versed in both TCM (Traditional Chinese Medicine) and conventional medicine, and I regularly further my education. Acupuncture is a self-contained, closed medical system, but I can bridge the gap to conventional medicine effectively. This allows for the integration of Eastern and Western healing methods. I tailor the care completely to your symptoms, underlying cause, and individual for the best possible outcome. I am genuinely interested in people and medicine. No treatment is the same, just as every person is unique. I work in a holistic manner and oversee everyone's healing process from intake to discharge. Through acupuncture and complementary treatment methods, such as Shiatsu massage and herbs, your health can be improved. You are most welcome in my practice.",
