    "bio": "I am Ingrid Hu and a certified acupuncturist. I am originally a chemical analyst and still work in this profession. Because of my work, I developed bursitis. In conventional care, I was given painkillers and an injection in my shoulder. My first thought was that I wanted to heal this in a natural way. By applying sports massage and trigger point massage, I no longer have any complaints. I also treat myself. I have been a sports masseur since 2016 and started my massage practice at home in 2017. My passion is to help people's pain complaints in a natural way. In 2017, I started the acupuncture training at Shenzhou University Amsterdam. The combination of massage and acupuncture yields good results. In August 2021, I completed the module on basic medical knowledge. Now I have expanded my practice Fong's Chi in Almere with acupuncture.",
