    "bio": "Mario de Wilde is an acupuncturist at Fysio Life. In addition to Traditional Chinese Medicine, he is trained in the method of Dr. R. Tan: Tan Balance Method Acupuncture. For which complaints is the Balance Method used? This method is very effective for treating pain complaints such as neck pain, back pain, headaches, and migraines, as well as overall disturbances of body and mind. This form of acupuncture is used for insomnia, fatigue, stress, and menopausal symptoms. Immediate pain relief thanks to Dr. Tan's acupuncture method. The Balance Method is very effective for treating all pain complaints. After needling the correct acupuncture points, you will experience immediate pain relief. So you will notice right away if it works. For lasting results, the treatment will need to be repeated several times. The acupuncture treatment The acupuncture needles are inserted into balancing meridians at a distance, not directly into the pain area itself. After stimulating certain acupuncture points, you will lie down for twenty to thirty minutes to let the treatment take effect. Then, the treatment will be evaluated, what to expect from the treatment will be discussed, and finally, a treatment plan will be created.",
