    "bio": "I am Gil Ton, Chinese medical therapist since 2011. I run my practice in the center of Amsterdam near the Weteringscircuit. In addition to treating people with all kinds of complaints, I am a teacher at the Dutch Acupuncture Academy. I also give lectures at various foreign training institutes and international congresses. The 7 years living in Asia have given me extensive knowledge and practical experience in acupuncture, both academically and clinically. I apply this in my practice in treating children and adults. The focus of my treatments is on pain management, gynecology, and pediatric disorders. My treatment methods include acupuncture treatments with fine thin needles, painless laser acupuncture, and Chinese herbal medicine. Where applicable, I provide tips and advice to be taken into account in daily life, to support healing and help prevent further complaints.",
