    "focus": "Acupuncture, Balance Method, Cupping, Japanese Acupuncture, Pediatric Acupuncture, Laser Acupuncture, Moxa, Ear Acupuncture, Chinese Herbs, Chinese Nutrition, Shiatsu, Electro-acupuncture, Cosmetische acupunctuur",
