    "bio": "People who come to Helios-Medica are not our customers but our guests. We live and love our work, which focuses on the individual and their needs. As experienced naturopaths, we stand for modern alternative medicine and innovative methods arising from the latest scientific findings. Acupuncture has a pain-relieving and calming effect and can therefore be helpful in chronic diseases and stress-related symptoms. Acupuncture treatment is also preventive because it has a relaxing effect and can strengthen the immune system. Adults and children can benefit from this gentle form of treatment. I use acupuncture to support women during pregnancy and preparation for childbirth. I also support couples with a desire for children. In our practice, there is an atmosphere of relaxation. During acupuncture treatment, you can relax and let your thoughts go. In a personal conversation and with the help of the diagnosis from Traditional Chinese Medicine, I analyze blockages of life energy in the body. The image of the flow of life energy in your body serves as the basis for the treatment plan. During acupuncture treatment, fine needles are placed at certain trigger points in the body to regulate and promote vital energy. I use very fine acupuncture needles to ensure a gentle therapy. I also use painless laser therapy. I complement the acupuncture treatment with herbal formulas and Western medicinal plant formulas that I personally tailor for you.",
