    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/13410/original/D4416_Foto_OlgaMeulenbroek.jpg?1703763504",
    "bio": "My name is Olga Meulenbroek, owner of Het Acupunctuurpunt since 2023. My path towards acupuncture is unusual: I have been working as a scientific researcher for a long time. First trained as a biologist and then after a promotion in neuroscience, I worked as a researcher in geriatric medicine for a while. After leaving the research, I started working at an health insurance company. I wanted to know how healthcare is viewed there and if I can contribute to its improvement. I still work there, but the need arose to do the training to become an Acupuncturist alongside my work and busy personal life, at Qing Bai in Nijmegen. I am convinced that Eastern and Western medicine should meet even more: a human being is so much more than the sum of its parts!",
