    "bio": "After working as a midwife and sonographer for more than 17 years, I have expanded my skills with acupuncture, breathwork, and massage. In acupuncture, I have found a new second passion, so how nice is it to combine these 2! I came into contact with acupuncture myself after experiencing 7 miscarriages and a pregnancy that was complicated by early pre-eclampsia and significant growth restriction. From a Western medical perspective, no cause was found for all these consecutive events and it was called 'bad luck'. In acupuncture, I found the solution to becoming and staying healthy during pregnancy. Ultimately, with the help of a fertility treatment, supported by acupuncture, I became pregnant healthily and complications were avoided. In 2024, I opened my practice In her Sense and I focus mainly on women's complaints.",
