    "bio": "My name is Bert Zandbergen. As a physiotherapist (1982) I came into contact with acupuncture. Graduated from the Anglo Dutch College of Acupuncture as an acupuncturist and herbalist. After practicing both fields side by side for ten years, I started studying psychology in 1995, resulting in a Master's degree in 2000. Since 2002, I have been combining these three fields in my acupuncture treatments. Recently, I have been treating various pain complaints remarkably successfully with acupuncture according to the Dr. Tan Balance method. Logically, orthopedic (pain) complaints and psycho-emotional disorders are my special areas of interest. In addition, I am well acquainted with the treatment of gynecological complaints. After more than 40 years, I am still enthusiastic about the choice I made in 1982.",
