    "bio": "I am Irmgard and I like to explore with you how you can find a better balance in your health. I listen to you - How and when did your complaint start? - What else was going on at that time? Think about changes in lifestyle, life events - When does your complaint improve or worsen? - What have you already done regarding your complaint? I am transparent in my search with you I will tell you, following our conversation, how I view your complaints from my expertise. I will explain what posture and lifestyle can mean for you. This way, you can learn to listen to signals from your body and take control of your own situation. I adjust the treatment based on your feedback.",
