    "bio": "Let me introduce myself: my name is John Terwal. The introduction to acupuncture has made a deep impression on me. My unceasing interest in medicine has led me to choose to become an acupuncturist. After completing my education at the TCMA, I graduated in 2009. I work with great pleasure and passion daily with the most diverse complaints, and this diversity makes acupuncture an exciting profession for me. Acupuncture involves working with people, so listening to what is being said and how it is being told is important. My motto is: look at the power of the needle. An important aspect of the profession is that there are always opportunities for me to further develop and draw more from experience.",
