    "bio": "My name is Yvonne Scheffer. After years of working in regular healthcare in the departments of pulmonology, oncology, and cardiology, I was ready for the next step. After being treated by a colleague from the hospital who was also an acupuncturist, it became clear in an instant. This is what I want too. After completing my training at TCMA, I started my practice. In January 2023, I completed the specialization oncology and acupuncture and also took a course in massage for cancer. Both mentally and physically, acupuncture can offer a lot of support. My goal is to contribute to the fact that acupuncture is used much more integrally. Fortunately, more and more hospitals are integrating complementary care, providing their clients with the best possible care.",
