    "bio": "It is my personal higher goal to work with acupuncture to maintain and restore your natural balance. Together we will learn to better understand your body and find that balance in an accessible way. Acupuncture has a preventive effect because it strengthens your self-healing ability. It can also help you alleviate and resolve complaints such as back pain, neck pain, and shoulder pain. Everyone is different and has their individual energy balance. Therefore, a treatment is always tailored. We not only address the symptom, but also the cause of the problem or complaint. Let it shine!",
