    "bio": "The human body is a wonderful thing. Vulnerable and powerful at the same time. As a doctor within Western Medicine, I noticed that little attention is paid to the body's self-healing ability. Although there is also a broad view of the human being, I missed treatment options that support the power of the body itself and encourage it to regain balance. I found this in Traditional Chinese Medicine. The magic of the needles! And also movement and nutrition. To teach people to listen to their bodies again and see what it really needs. And then a beautiful whole emerges for recovery and maintaining health. I find that treatment from Traditional Chinese Medicine fits very nicely alongside treatment from Western Medicine, truly complementary to each other. Best of both worlds, with the human being at the center!",
