    "bio": "I am Femke Van Renterghem and have a practice specialized in acupuncture for pain and oncology. As a specialized oncology acupuncturist, I can help you with indications such as nausea and vomiting during chemotherapy, fatigue and insomnia, hot flashes and sweating during anti-hormonal therapy, decreased appetite, dry mouth, pain complaints, peripheral neuropathy (CIPN) due to chemotherapy, and feelings of sadness and anxiety. Acupuncture can be used as a complementary treatment alongside conventional treatment for cancer. Both around treatments with chemo-, radio- or anti-hormonal therapy and during the recovery period afterwards. It can provide support and relief from side effects and improve quality of life. Specialized in menopausal symptoms Specialized oncology acupuncturist Specialized in effectively treating pain with acupuncture or laser therapy",
