    "bio": "Moon Yueh Fong specializes in acupuncture and Chinese herbs for treating all kinds of physical pain, skin diseases, digestive problems, insomnia, infertility, and women's complaints. She obtained her BSc and MSc studies in TCM at the university level (a seven-year full-time program). This has given her the opportunity to delve into the deep knowledge of Traditional Chinese Medicine, both theoretically and practically. During her stay in China, she apprenticed under various renowned TCM doctors at the Guangzhou University of TCM, specializing in gynecology, dermatology, and gastroenterology. Her BSc thesis on the study of acupuncture and Chinese herbs for infertility was published in the English journal Journal of Chinese Medicine (2016). Additionally, she wrote her Master's thesis on Chinese herbs under the guidance of one of the top TCM doctors from China.",
