    "bio": "My name is Nienke Kruiswijk, mother of four sons. Living in Wormer, where my practice is located. Specialist in care for people with pain, discomfort, and stress. Both acute and chronic. The treatment involves a combination of tuina, acupuncture, and Chinese herbs. In addition to the above, I am specialized in guiding pregnant women and young children, both from my expertise as a prenatal yoga teacher and from Traditional Chinese Medicine. Women seeking guidance during their pregnancy due to pregnancy-related complaints and/or wanting to prepare for childbirth, as well as young parents with questions about the early period with their little one, are very welcome. I treat children with tuina. Additionally, I teach parents how to use tuina at home.",
