    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/13395/original/20170331_130813.jpeg?1700254162",
    "bio": "The power of acupuncture My life is all about everything related to energies. As a child, I felt a lot of things that I couldn't explain with my rational mind. The fact that there is more between heaven and earth was a given for me. Acupuncture has always caught my attention, especially because I benefited greatly from acupuncture treatments myself. Severe migraine attacks in my puberty were 'pricked away' within five minutes by Dr. Kudus, a pediatrician and acupuncturist. He was a great example for me and the reason I wanted to study acupuncture. A fall on my tailbone while rollerblading, where the attending doctor said I wouldn't be able to walk for at least six months, was completely resolved after two treatments by Dr. Kudus. The conventional doctor was amazed that I was walking normally again two weeks later. A chronic and painful bursitis in my shoulder disappeared after 5-6 treatments. And so on... The effect of acupuncture is miraculous! As a graduate acupuncturist, I am very happy to be able to help people with (pain) complaints myself now. In addition, I attend as many further training courses as possible to deepen and broaden my knowledge. Our body is a micro-reflection of all life on Earth and in the universe. “ As above, so below, as within, so without” For me, there is nothing more beautiful than being able to connect you with your own microcosm: with yourself, your body, and your own energy!",
