    "bio": "My practice is located within Health Center Goverwelle in Gouda. The center offers a range of disciplines and services, with the aim of collaborating as effectively as possible for your health and well-being. So, a multi-disciplinary approach, allowing your health problem, if necessary, to be assessed and treated from multiple perspectives. I work together with general practitioners and physiotherapists, among others. Acupuncture and Western medicine have been shown to complement each other very well in this way, resulting in optimal treatment and guidance. Acupuncture is an effective and safe treatment method for many chronic as well as acute conditions. In my research and treatment, I consider, in addition to purely physical factors, other factors such as the emotional burden and background that often accompany physical conditions. I therefore warmly invite you to take a look at our website. You can also of course contact us directly for further information or to make an appointment.",
