    "bio": "After my physiotherapy training, I already knew after a year that I wanted to give treatments in my practice in a different way. I was curious about the Eastern holistic view of medicine in which body and mind are seen as one unit. Every person is unique and deserves a personal approach. I focus on the self-healing ability of the client's body. I try to explain acupuncture in a clear and down-to-earth way. Since 1993, I have been working complementary and combining acupuncture and physiotherapy in my treatments. Thanks to my experiences and the many additional trainings I have done, I can now listen well to the needs of my clients and together with him or her, provide a tailor-made treatment. My specializations are all muscle and joint complaints, neurological problems, infertility, pregnancy, menstrual and menopausal complaints. Furthermore, I support many people with cancer during their regular therapies to improve the quality of their lives. Prevention takes place through lifestyle coaching and dietary advice.",
