    "bio": "My name is Kelly Groot. I knew I would study acupuncture quickly, but because I was selected for the physiotherapy course, I did that first. I thought; a good foundation is not wrong. During my physiotherapy internship, I started the acupuncture course at Shenzou University in Amsterdam. In the year 2000, I graduated as a physiotherapist and a year later as an acupuncturist. After working for seven years as an employee, my partner Werner (physiotherapist) and I set up PraktijkAndijk. We offer physiotherapy, acupuncture, and the RADTS/lifestyle test. We aim for sustainable recovery and work closely with a dietitian and psychosomatic care. We are open to all your questions and work together towards the right form of recovery.",
