    "bio": "In 2007 I started my practice. Started in the attic and built a practice space at home in 2009. If you want to know more about my career, I gladly refer you to Linkedin. In my practice, I have one treatment room and during the treatment, I stay in the same room as you. What makes the work so enjoyable for me is the contact with my clients. And every time puzzling how to best help someone, always a nice challenge. And if it succeeds in making someone feel better, then two people are happy :-). In addition to treating the symptoms, I look for the underlying cause of the complaints. The treatment is completely tailored to you. My specializations are pain management and oncology. The practice is also listed in the regular referral guide of the Comprehensive Cancer Center Netherlands (IKNL). Acupuncture goes well with a Western conventional treatment. You can come for treatment without a referral. You are very welcome! With kind regards, Gretha",
