    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/12938/original/gaby-heijer-naumann.jpg?1680531894",
    "bio": "My name is Gaby Heijer-Naumann and I have been working as a complementary therapist since 2002. In my practice, in addition to acupuncture, I use multiple treatment methods, such as bioresonance and laser therapy. Additionally, with the help of the Oberon Pathfinder, I can perform a health scan and provide advice on the use of dietary supplements as needed. Since my adolescence, I have struggled with recurring asthmatic bronchitis, allergies, and chronic sinus infections. At that time, a comprehensive medication package, including antibiotics and prednisone, was considered by my treating physicians as the only approach. I now know from experience that there is another way, and I have been medication-free for years. I would like to help others experience this as well. I adhere to the principle that three to four treatments should yield a clear positive result to determine the effectiveness of my approach.",
