    "bio": "My name is Annelieke Misset - van de Wetering and I live in Apeldoorn. In 2017 I came into contact with acupuncture for the first time and I was captivated by the good results of this treatment method. I decided to study at the TCMA in Utrecht. As I delved deeper into Chinese medicine, my interest continued to grow. In Chinese medicine, the focus is on zooming out on a complaint, to view the person as a whole and to find out what the cause is. Body and mind are closely connected and everything is a whole. After years of working in a hospital, it was time to follow my passion for Chinese medicine. With the aim of being able to contribute to the health of people and enjoy a fantastic life! You are welcome at Practice Pietersen in Apeldoorn. At www.practicepietersen.nl will find more information about the practice and the other treatment disciplines. Practice information Practice Pietersen Asselsestraat 76 7311 EP Apeldoorn Contact information annelieke@practicepietersen.nl 055 5790384",
