    "bio": "Dr. Ineke van den Berg, LAc I am happy to provide you with care for complex and long-term (pain) problems. Think, for example, of recovery after COVID, recurring complaints of joints and organs, menopausal symptoms, CRPS but also fertility problems, pregnancy, and postoperative complaints. By unraveling them together with recognized knowledge of Eastern and Western medicine. While doctors in Western medicine are more inclined to only look at the complaint and treat it, Eastern healthcare seeks the connection with other complaints and thus the cause. Traditional Chinese Medicine can therefore also work preventively. Care for you: by using additional complementary care such as (ear) acupuncture, Meridian stretching, BEST psychopuncture, and dietary advice. I complement this with multidisciplinary knowledge and insights from physiotherapy, pain management, and scientific research. You can find my contribution to this, among other things, in my dissertation https://repub.eur.nl/pub/21816 and on my website.",
