    "bio": "My name is Sandy To, acupuncturist and pharmacist. The Chinese (Eastern) culture and method of treatment, which I have inherited from my family, have always fascinated me: soup with different herbs at the change of seasons or a very bitter herbal drink for severe flu symptoms. This is also one of the reasons why during my pharmacy studies at Utrecht University, I decided to also pursue the five-year training in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) at the Open University Shen Zhou in Amsterdam. In addition, I am very interested in the combination of conventional and complementary treatment methods and I find the addition of complementary treatment to conventional treatment valuable. Care is tailor-made. Everyone is different, so there is no best treatment but a treatment that suits you best.",
