    "bio": "In order to heal you need to feel. In my practice you work - feel - actively participate in your recovery. This is based on the idea that every person is their own best medicine. Spirit Path is a practice for acupuncture and bodywork in Utrecht. Based on Traditional Chinese Medicine, I approach your complaints and humanity on five levels: physical, mental, emotional, spiritual, and energetic. Through conversation, touch, breathing, and the needling of acupuncture points suitable for you, we strive together for homeostasis - achieving balance. By opening the practice, I am back on my own Spirit Path after a long detour: that of 'what I wanted to be in the past' - doctor, healer.",
