    "bio": "Practice for Acupuncture Corinne Koning Hello my name is Corinne Koning. In 2011 I started my own practice in Chinese Medicine and specifically acupuncture, it turned out to be my great passion. Chinese Medicine is able to identify the cause of all kinds of conditions and to make logical connections between different complaints. Not feeling well or unexplained conditions, the human body appears to be one big interplay between body and emotions. Nutrition, drinking, family ailments, stress, and intense events appear to play a major role. Finding the cause and working towards recovery from there, that appears to be the formula for healing and feeling better in practice. In addition, I use acupuncture, provide advice on the role of the right breakfast, nutrition, and drinking in general, and after treatment, customers often go home with advice for juices and beneficial herbal teas. More information can be found on my site www.acupunctuuredam.nl I welcome you to the practice to see what the cause and logic are behind your complaints",
