    "bio": "From a young age, I have been interested in other cultures, health, and lifestyles. For hours on end, I could (and can) entertain myself by studying these subjects from all possible angles. Not surprising, then, that the Western view on health was not complete enough for me. After completing my physiotherapy training in 2017, I quickly realized in practice that many complaints arise from deeper patterns and/or are maintained. This led me to pursue the training to become an Acupuncturist, a more than 3000-year-old healing method with a completely different view on human functioning. I successfully completed this training in 2023 at the Qing Bai Academy in Amersfoort. Currently, I combine my work as a physiotherapist in the 2nd line with great satisfaction with my acupuncture practice at home.",
