    "bio": "My name is Caroline van der Werff, after my training as an Integrative Massage Therapist, I delved into Traditional Chinese Medicine at the Qing Bai Academy in Breda, where I also subsequently completed my training in Western Medical Basic Knowledge. I now work with great pleasure as an acupuncturist in my practice at Padma Centrum Middelburg. Discovering the Origin of the complaint, restoring balance in the lives of patients, recovery and support physically and emotionally through Acupuncture and lifestyle advice are my top priorities. My specialties include: Andrological disorders and male fertility problems (according to TCM), thyroid problems, Skull Acupuncture, and many other conditions that can be supported or treated with Acupuncture and various other techniques. I regularly attend further training courses in both Western Medical and Traditional and Modern Chinese. If you are experiencing complaints and are considering acupuncture, please contact me directly, you are welcome in my practice. You can leave appointments by voicemail, message, or email, and I will contact you afterwards.",
