    "bio": "You are very welcome to work with me on your health. With acupuncture, you will find balance again and the self-healing ability of your body and mind will be stimulated. I work in open conversation with clients. Your input is important for targeted treatment. Often, you know where a complaint comes from yourself, or we will find out together, which contributes to the treatment. Stress, digestive complaints, migraines, painful muscles/joints, pregnancy, menopause, fatigue, side effects of chemotherapy, recovery after surgery, sadness, frustration. Complaints, acute or chronic, often limit you daily. I am happy to treat you, with the aim of reducing these complaints and restoring your body and mind. In addition to needles, I also use tuina, foot reflexology, and cupping.",
