    "bio": "My name is Weixi Yuan and I obtained my acupuncture diploma at the Shenzhou Open University of traditional Chinese medicine in Amsterdam. In addition, I have a master's degree in health sciences and a bachelor's degree in physiotherapy. After obtaining my master's degree, I have worked in various branches in the healthcare sector. Healthcare is a lifelong passion. This is because many of my family members work in the healthcare sector. It has been instilled in me from a young age that good health is the foundation of life. I became fascinated by acupuncture because, in my belief, it is the most natural and holistic way to maintain or achieve good health. Since everyone is different, I provide personalized treatment. The individual is central to me. I am a calm and optimistic person. I respect my patients and listen carefully to them. My goal is to improve and maintain people's health.",
