    "bio": "My name is Boudewijn de Jong and my practice focuses on classical acupuncture, supplemented with various specializations. It gives me a lot of satisfaction when I can help people who have been suffering from pain or other unpleasant problems for years and that they are free of their problem after a number of treatments. As an acupuncturist, I am someone who looks for alternatives and thinks outside the box. For this, I use various methods from classical Traditional Chinese Medicine, as well as the Master Tung method and ear acupuncture. I also use cupping and moxibustion. Because I extensively investigate what is going on, I take plenty of time for my clients. My practice is located at the MCNA in Heerenveen where I work together with two doctors and five therapists. For more information about the practice and my treatments, visit www.acupunctuur.frl. If you want more information about the center where I work, visit www.mcna.nl. Practice",
