    "bio": "I am Mariska Putters, born in 1980 and raised in Harderwijk. In 2017, I graduated cum laude from the Traditional Chinese Medicine Academy Netherlands (TCMA) as an acupuncturist and started my practice in oriental medicine. Before starting my practice, I worked in the equestrian sport, automotive industry, construction industry, and retail. I optimized work processes and supported financial, ICT, and administrative processes. As a child, I was already interested in the human body, its functioning, and all the mysteries it entails. My hobby is equestrian sports, and through this world, I came into contact with oriental medicine and acupuncture. In my practice, it's all about you. Attention, honesty, and to the point are my keywords.",
