    "bio": "Pro4AM B.V. - Practice for Acupuncture Welcome! My name is Amelita Maassen. My dream is that all people live from their inner strength with joy! Why \"Living from inner strength with joy\"? Living from inner strength is, for me, living from my core, where I stand in my power for who I am. This makes me happy and brings joy. What could this mean for you? Joy has a positive influence on your health, energetic balance, and actions. How beautiful would it be to live from inner strength with joy without complaints. My old dear friend and acupuncturist inspired me to study acupuncture. The moments with my 'guinea pigs' during my acupuncture training were simply enjoyable. This has only strengthened my love for acupuncture. Physical complaints are often not taken seriously in this hectic society. You are expected to carry on. You have to be strong. There is no time to pay attention to what actually requires your attention. Your own self, which can lead to physical complaints. My acupuncture treatment focuses on recovery and prevention of worsening.",
