    "bio": "I am Simone Thewissen, specialized in stress complaints in women. I help you to take a different path, away from an impending burnout, towards peace and space in your mind and body, and free from pain. In my practice, women come who have so much stress from everything that is needed to keep their family, work, and social life running smoothly, that their heads are overflowing and they feel tension, unrest, and even pain in their bodies. I ensure that they regain peace in their bodies and space in their minds, and can live their lives pain-free again. Because I am both a Ph.D. chemist and an acupuncturist, I combine a no-nonsense investigative attitude with the power of acupuncture.",
