    "bio": "My name is Monique van de Geest-Rietvelt. My practice San Bao acupuncture is located in Berkel en Rodenrijs. Due to my great interest in healthcare and alternative medicine, I studied nursing for a year and a half at the University of Applied Sciences in Rotterdam, and then completed the four-year HBO course in basic medical knowledge and acupuncture at the TCMA (Traditional Chinese Medicine Academy). I regularly attend further training to keep my knowledge of both Western and Eastern medicine up to date. For more information or to make an appointment, you can visit my website.",
