    "bio": "Do you recognize the situation where you are sent from doctor to doctor with persistent complaints and after ten minutes, you are back outside with yet another ointment or pill? My interest in living in harmony and together with nature has been with me since childhood, when I first learned about Indians who lived completely isolated from the rest of the world in the Amazon region. On a small scale, but with maximum attention to the human and his environment, I treat not so much the complaint but the human as a whole. In addition to herbs, massage, and acupuncture, I also provide lifestyle, exercise, and dietary advice, all according to the guidelines of Traditional Chinese Medicine. Body and mind are optimally balanced. This way, the body is able to connect with nature, resulting in healing. Curious if this is something for you? Quickly make an appointment with Practice Su Zi Acupuncture.",
