    "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/assets1.acupunctuur.nl/profiles/11762/original/IMG-9534.jpg?1680531684",
    "bio": "My name is Fenanja Bouman-van Dijk, originally from Twente, but I have been here long enough to understand the Tukkerse language. I have a practice behind the house, where I 'work' with a lot of pleasure. In principle, I treat all complaints, but the women who find my practice mainly come with problems related to their menstrual cycle, complaints around menopause, with a desire to have children where they may or may not undergo a fertility trajectory. But also with pain complaints that I treat using Dr. Tan's method, where the pain should decrease by half on the spot. I support this with advice on lifestyle and nutrition and what can be combined with Bach Flower Remedies and insights from Access Consciousness. What I find special about acupuncture is the holistic aspect; we look at the whole body, make connections that conventional medicine cannot make, allowing someone to make progress in their healing process. Sometimes miracles happen that the physiotherapist in me cannot explain; then I try to remember that I am Chinese inside and that there is so much more possible. You are very welcome to experience it!",
