    "bio": "I am Tamara Jansen, a certified acupuncturist in Haarlem. In my practice, I work with classical Chinese acupuncture to rebalance your body. Acupuncture helps with various complaints such as stress, fatigue, pain, and hormonal imbalance. My approach is holistic and personal: I look at you as a whole and tailor each treatment to your situation. Where necessary, I support acupuncture with techniques such as cupping, moxa, or nutritional advice. With my background in psychosocial counseling and over 25 years of experience in Tai Chi and Chi Kung, I offer a calm, safe environment where you can recover and build new energy.",
