    "bio": "I started my working life as a physiotherapist and movement scientist and taught this at a university in Scotland. After a detour into the business world, I am back with my first love, the human body and health. The combination of the holistic view of health from Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) and the rapid results of the Dr. Tan method provide a treatment approach that quickly leads to beautiful results for a wide variety of complaints, including back/neck pain, injuries and vague pains to insomnia, burnout and post-viral complaints. As part of my further education, I went on a study trip to China, to the Peoples Hospital in Qing Dao.",
