    "bio": "I am Xinye Yu, acupuncturist, born in China and established in Huissen since 2010. I graduated from the Qing Bai Academy. Additionally, I have completed a very intensive internship in China at the acupuncture department of Hu Bei University. Due to my Chinese background, I am familiar with the ancient Chinese culture and Traditional Chinese Medicine. Therefore, as an acupuncturist, I automatically look at my clients' complaints with a Chinese perspective. From the Chinese philosophy, we consider humans and nature as one harmonious entity. When the harmony between humans and nature is disrupted, various complaints can arise. Working from my Chinese philosophy and expertise, I will try to restore the harmony. Acupuncture is one of the key methods within Traditional Chinese Medicine.",
