    "bio": "My name is Marlon Tjin-A-Koeng After completing my bachelor's degree in pathology (1994), I started working in various hospitals and developed into a Pathology Assistant at Symbiant Alkmaar, where I work two days a week. In 2008, I completed my acupuncture studies at Shenzhou University in Amsterdam. I now have my own practice, working three days a week. I have also completed various courses to become a comprehensive TCM therapist, such as herbal medicine and tuina. My practice also serves as a training facility; I mentor many interns. Since 2014, I have been a lecturer in acupuncture and tuina at Shenzhou University in Amsterdam. I have been practicing Shaolin Kung Fu since 1984, where I also teach movement theory, Qi Gong, and Tai Chi in my spare time.",
