    "bio": "I am Hilde ten Cate, living together with my partner Ben. Together we are the proud parents of Fynn, Nolan, and Brenn. After starting in education as a teacher and math teacher, I have been active in acupuncture and Eastern medicine for several years now. I regularly follow further education and additional studies to keep my knowledge up to date and expand it. My specializations are treating pain and stress complaints and treating more chronic complaints and children. My goal is to introduce as many adults and children as possible to acupuncture and Eastern medicine. To let them experience what a wonderful addition acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine can offer to Western medicine.",
