    "bio": "I am Ton van Huffelen, studied history and have always done a lot of Qi Gong. I wanted to know more about the background of Qi Gong. In 1997 I started with an introductory course in Chinese philosophy at an acupuncture training. Entirely without obligation, I thought. From hobby my attention shifted to study and profession. That's how acupuncture found me. I graduated in 2002. Since 2003, I specialize in Japanese acupuncture/Toyohari. For you as a client, a pleasant form of acupuncture: it is gentle and powerful. I work from acupuncture point to acupuncture point: during the treatment I tune in to how you are doing. The goal of a treatment is to restore your basic energy balance and reduce your symptoms. I like to work with Qi Gong exercises and lifestyle and nutrition advice.",
