    "bio": "My name is Michelle van der Weijden. Qualified Mensendieck exercise therapist and acupuncturist. Through my own experience with acupuncture, I became interested in Traditional Chinese Medicine. As a Mensendieck exercise therapist, I felt like something was missing in the treatment. What that something was only became clear to me after I came into contact with acupuncture. With the combination of acupuncture and exercise therapy, I can now help people internally and externally. In 2015, I graduated from the Amsterdam University of Applied Sciences as an exercise therapist. After three years of practice, I started the training to become an acupuncturist at the TCMA. Here, I graduated with honors in 2021. More information: www.acupunctuurvanderweijden.nl",
