    "bio": "As a former nurse, I was already fascinated by illness, the causes and treatments thereof. The classical acupuncture training was such an eye-opener for me to interpret illness differently and more understandably that it has never let me go. Every day I continue to educate myself in this fantastic healing method that inspires me every day to want to know more about it. Moreover, during my treatments there is still \"time\" for the people because the personal attention we can give each other sometimes works as healing. The complaints my clients come with are very diverse, which ensures that it is never boring, there are no ready-made solutions available, and with each new client I go together in search of the most healing solution at that moment. I experience it as a challenging, sometimes tough but also very grateful profession.",
