    "bio": "Unique approach to health Each person and each body is unique and constantly changing. In my practice, I discovered how thoughts and stress influence our health. This inspired me to study acupuncture, where I learned about the energy systems of the human body and the five natural elements. With this knowledge, I developed a holistic approach that promotes both physical and mental health. About me I am Kulneerapat Hector Kongsuwan, founder of Yin Die Acupuncture in Gilze. In 2015, I started my practice in naturopathy, and in 2024, I completed a bachelor's degree in basic medical knowledge and acupuncture at the TCMA. To keep my knowledge up-to-date, I regularly attend courses in both Western and Eastern medicine. With my diverse therapies, I seek the best approach for recovery and health for each client. Preventing complaints is also an important part of my work. For more information or to make an appointment, visit my website.",
