    "bio": "I chose acupuncture because I am fascinated by the power of this ancient Chinese healing method. The idea that I can relieve pain and bring the body into balance with just a few strategically placed needles is incredibly intriguing to me. Moreover, it feels like a superpower to activate the body's self-healing ability without medication. Acupuncture is like finding the 'reset button' for body and mind, and I find that exceptionally inspiring. It is wonderful to see people leave the treatment room relaxed and relieved, and I love being part of their healing process.",
