    "bio": "My name is Geertje van den Burgh. Selfwise is a practice for people who want to address their physical or psychological complaints or maintain their health in a broad sense. The approach is a combination of acupuncture, nutrition, herbs, supplements, psychology, and shamanism. This can help reduce or eliminate complaints and obstacles. It can also lead to a profound understanding of the underlying causes of complaints. The treatment is tailor-made; we look together at what you need and want to achieve. About me: from a young age, I had a passion for healing body and mind. That's why I became a psychologist and worked in this field for many years. In addition to involving the body in treatments, I also became an acupuncturist and developed a broad knowledge of health, which I apply in the forests of Bilthoven.",
