    "bio": "After a long working period, especially in the hospital in Western healthcare, I was captivated by Chinese and Western natural healing methods, under the motto 'naturally better'. It is impressive to experience what nature has to offer for a wide range of complaints and/or symptoms or discomforts. Different treatment methods can run alongside each other for an optimal result. Such as the recognized specialization of acupuncture in oncology treatment. The beauty in this profession is to always choose the best and connect with the person with the possibilities that exist. My interest is both broad and specific in the treatment of all kinds of pain and discomforts such as in the musculoskeletal system and the gastrointestinal tract. Where relevant, attention is paid to nutrition. Digestion and intestines are an important basis in (maintaining) health! The use of Biofeedback (Quest 9) provides a deepening of insight and treatment of complaints.",
